<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN GIB SEES FULL YR PROFITS RISING.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN GIB SEES FULL YR PROFITS RISING.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian retail group GIB said on Thursday full year 1996 net profits and operating cashflow would show an improvement on 1995 levels.</p>
<p>The rise would be largely due to better results at it GB Supermarkets division and U.S. home-improvements chain Scotty's.</p>
<p>The group said it made the forecast with the reservation that annual results were always strongly influenced by the level of sales in the closing months of the year.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
